&\mathrm{mv}=\frac{6.626 \times 10^{-24}}{3.3}=2 \times 10^{-24} \mathrm{~kg} \mathrm{~m} \,\mathrm{sec}{ }^{-1}
\end{aligned}
$$

Kinetic energy $=\frac{1}{2} m v^{2}$

$$
\begin{aligned}
&=\frac{(\mathrm{mv})^{2}}{2 \mathrm{~m}} \\\\
