We find the change in Gibbs free energy $\Delta G^0$:

$$
\begin{align}
\Delta G^0 & = \Delta H^0 - T \Delta S^0 \\\\
& = -54070 - (10 \times 298) \\\\
& = -54070 - 2980 \\\\
