$${a^2} + {b^2} = {\cos ^2}5\theta - {\sin ^2}5\theta = \cos 10\theta = \cos {{10\pi } \over {24}}$$

and $$0 < \cos {{5\pi } \over {12}} < 1 $$

$$\Rightarrow 0 \le {a^2} + {b^2} \le 1$$

question:
If the matrix $$A = \left[ {\matrix{
